  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sports , Education for Child Protection- Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will promote better livelihoods  for 1000 Children in 6 villages between the ages of 3- 10  .  The program will    build and promote 6 Community  based centres In rural Western Zimbabwe.Children from underpriviledged families , will learn lifeskills ,basic literacy and numeracy skills as well as discipline centred sporting activities.we have 5 years working with children from poor families in our community  due to age and disability.Our aim is to ensure they become better leaders.</narrative>
  </description>
